  "About": {
    "story": "My path to product design has been a rocky one.\n\nMy academic path began as a pre-med, only to realize that following strict protocols wasn’t meant for me.\n\nI believe the best designers are rebellious by nature.\n\nI’ve never truly felt like I belonged anywhere.\n\ndadwdawd\n\nMy whole life has been a series of pivots.\n\nI have quite the unconventional background.\n\nI started my studies\n\nHere are a few snippets that shed a bit of light into my too-many-too-count interests.\n\ndadwdawd\n\nWork hard. Play hard. \n\nNever stop learning.",
